	(text "note about legal review:\nhttps://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=CELEX:02014R0003-20161016\nhttps://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg_del/2014/44/oj/eng\n\nANNEX II PART 1 -> ask if for horn or also the audible tell tall for blinker\n\nVCU need to be always ON for the warning to always operate.\nNeed current sensing on light output to indicate fault of light. (change blinker tone for instance)\n\nFlyback protection by default on output\nadd gate resistor on mosfet\ntvs diode on 12V Bus to avoid load switching surge from injecting transient.\nmain fuse for VCU, maybe resettabel fuse for the mosftet ouput ? \nProove endurance of VCU, show junction temp margin, cycle margin for 5 year / 16500 km\n\nSeat sensor is legally required (if rider leave while in driving mode)\ndouble action to start, (power on + non latching drive selector)\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
